{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14231780","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14231780","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423178001:1":{"text":"나도 최근에야 알게된 건데, 제국 시기의 드워프들도 모아 강철을 썼다더군!","source_cn":"我也是最近才知道，帝国时期的矮人用的也是魔钢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0045E8011E7D797","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423178002:0":{"text":"그땐 모아 강철을 깊은바위 강철이라고 불렀대. 깊은바위 마을이라는 이름도 거기서 유래된 거였고!","source_cn":"他们把魔钢叫做深岩钢，这才是深岩村名字的真正由来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA115774C1DC29D4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423178003:1":{"text":"돌고 돌아서 우리 드워프들이 원래의 길로 돌아온 셈이지...","source_cn":"兜兜转转，我们矮人又回到之前的路上了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAE7DC2F92119AB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:监工特特里":{"text":"현장 감독 테테리","source":"监工特特里","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}